---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Partners — SENTINEL MAN"
  description="Media kit for partners, creators, podcasters and integrators promoting SENTINEL MAN. Approved blurbs, logo pack, founder quotes, compliance guardrails."
>
  <div class="content-wrap">

    <div class="content-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">PARTNERS</div>
      <h1>Promote SENTINEL with<br /><strong>the right materials.</strong></h1>
      <p class="lead">For creators, podcasters, newsletter authors, partner founders, and integrators. Drop-in copy, brand assets, founder quotes, and compliance guardrails so you can talk about SENTINEL the way SENTINEL talks about itself.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">PARTNER CONTACT</div>
      <h2>One inbox. <strong>Subject: PARTNER.</strong></h2>
      <div class="press-contact">
        <a href="mailto:support@sentinelman.com?subject=PARTNER" class="press-email">support@sentinelman.com</a>
        <p>Mark your subject line <code>PARTNER</code> and we route to the founder. Response within 48 hours AEST, Monday to Friday.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">APPROVED BLURBS</div>
      <h2>Drop these in. <strong>No edits required.</strong></h2>
      <div class="press-lines">
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">10 WORDS — TAGLINE / SOCIAL POST</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">Performance intelligence system for high-stakes men. Daily AI command brief.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">30 WORDS — NEWSLETTER / BLOG INTRO</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">SENTINEL MAN is an AI performance intelligence system for high-stakes men. It tracks operational state, analyses decisions across five AI lanes, and delivers a daily command brief — in performance language, not wellness language.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">80 WORDS — PODCAST READ / EPISODE INTRO</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">SENTINEL MAN is a performance intelligence system built for men who reject wellness framing. The product runs five AI models in parallel to analyse decisions — including a contrarian and a pre-mortem failure-mode forecaster, builds a personal pattern model from daily check-ins, and delivers operational intelligence rather than therapeutic content. Built by Nick Lord in Sydney after years using a private version of the same methodology. Web at sentinelman.com — 7-day free trial, no credit card required.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">EMAIL SIGNATURE LINE</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">I run on SENTINEL MAN — the performance intelligence system for men who decide for a living. <a href="https://sentinelman.com">sentinelman.com</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">MEDIA KIT</div>
      <h2>Logos, screenshots, <strong>brand reference.</strong></h2>
      <div class="press-assets">
        <div class="press-asset">
          <a href="/logo.png" download="sentinel-man-logo.png" class="asset-tile">
            <img src="/logo.png" alt="Sentinel Man primary logo" />
          </a>
          <div class="asset-meta">
            <div class="asset-name">Primary logo (PNG)</div>
            <div class="asset-spec">1024×1024 · gold on midnight</div>
            <a href="/logo.png" download="sentinel-man-logo.png" class="asset-download">Download →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="press-asset">
          <a href="/logo.svg" download="sentinel-man-logo.svg" class="asset-tile">
            <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Sentinel Man logo SVG" />
          </a>
          <div class="asset-meta">
            <div class="asset-name">Primary logo (SVG)</div>
            <div class="asset-spec">Vector · scales clean to any size</div>
            <a href="/logo.svg" download="sentinel-man-logo.svg" class="asset-download">Download →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="press-asset">
          <a href="/og-image.png" download="sentinel-man-social-card.png" class="asset-tile asset-tile-wide">
            <img src="/og-image.png" alt="Sentinel Man social share card" />
          </a>
          <div class="asset-meta">
            <div class="asset-name">Social share card</div>
            <div class="asset-spec">1200×630 PNG · for Twitter / LinkedIn / blog inline</div>
            <a href="/og-image.png" download="sentinel-man-social-card.png" class="asset-download">Download →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="press-asset">
          <a href="/icon-512.png" download="sentinel-man-icon.png" class="asset-tile asset-tile-small">
            <img src="/icon-512.png" alt="Sentinel Man app icon" />
          </a>
          <div class="asset-meta">
            <div class="asset-name">App icon</div>
            <div class="asset-spec">512×512 PNG · for app-store style features</div>
            <a href="/icon-512.png" download="sentinel-man-icon.png" class="asset-download">Download →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="press-aux"><strong>Product screenshots</strong> available on request — email <code>PARTNER — Screenshots</code> with the screens you want (TODAY · COCKPIT · DECIDE · INTEL · DEBRIEF). We'll send a clean ZIP rendered at 2x for retina display.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">BRAND REFERENCE</div>
      <h2>Match us. <strong>Don't recolour us.</strong></h2>
      <div class="brand-grid">
        <div class="brand-block">
          <div class="brand-block-label">COLOURS</div>
          <div class="brand-swatch" style="background:#001F3F">
            <span class="swatch-name">NAVY</span>
            <span class="swatch-hex">#001F3F</span>
            <span class="swatch-use">Marketing world</span>
          </div>
          <div class="brand-swatch" style="background:#0D0D1A">
            <span class="swatch-name">MIDNIGHT</span>
            <span class="swatch-hex">#0D0D1A</span>
            <span class="swatch-use">App interior</span>
          </div>
          <div class="brand-swatch" style="background:#FFDC00;color:#0D0D1A">
            <span class="swatch-name">GOLD</span>
            <span class="swatch-hex">#FFDC00</span>
            <span class="swatch-use">Mark + accents</span>
          </div>
          <div class="brand-swatch" style="background:#0074D9">
            <span class="swatch-name">ELECTRIC BLUE</span>
            <span class="swatch-hex">#0074D9</span>
            <span class="swatch-use">App accent (interior only)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="brand-block">
          <div class="brand-block-label">TYPOGRAPHY</div>
          <div class="brand-type">
            <div class="brand-type-name" style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace">JetBrains Mono</div>
            <div class="brand-type-use">Headers, labels, numerics. Cockpit / instrument feel.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="brand-type">
            <div class="brand-type-name" style="font-family:Rubik, sans-serif">Rubik / Nunito</div>
            <div class="brand-type-use">Body prose. Marketing site uses Rubik; app uses Nunito.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="brand-block">
          <div class="brand-block-label">VOICE</div>
          <div class="brand-voice">Operator dialect. Short declarative sentences. No hedging, no flattery, no emojis. Numbers are precise. The system refers to itself as <code>SENTINEL</code> — never "we", "I", or "the AI".</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">FOUNDER QUOTES</div>
      <h2>Attributable lines from <strong>Nick Lord, founder.</strong></h2>
      <div class="press-lines">
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">ON THE PRODUCT'S POSITIONING</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">"There's no shortage of wellness apps for men. There's a shortage of operational instruments. SENTINEL MAN is the second thing."</div>
        </div>
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">ON THE OPERATOR THE PRODUCT IS BUILT FOR</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">"The man we built this for doesn't want to be encouraged. He wants a second set of eyes that doesn't blink, doesn't flatter, and remembers what he told it last Tuesday."</div>
        </div>
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">ON WHY THE 5-LANE DECISION COUNCIL</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">"Single-model AI gives confident answers. Five models running in parallel — each with a different mandate, including a contrarian and a pre-mortem failure-mode forecaster — give you the friction you'd get from a real council. Then the synthesis pass writes the call, with a disclosure showing exactly what the AI was given to reason from."</div>
        </div>
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">ON DATA + PRIVACY</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">"The operator's data stays the operator's. Privacy Act APP 11 and 12 aren't a marketing line — they're a one-tap export and a one-tap delete inside the app."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="press-aux">Use any of the above verbatim. Attribute to <strong>Nick Lord, Founder, SENTINEL MAN</strong>.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">Q&amp;A PRIMER</div>
      <h2>What your audience will ask. <strong>Approved answers.</strong></h2>
      <div class="qa-list">
        <div class="qa-item">
          <div class="qa-q">Is this a mental health app?</div>
          <div class="qa-a">No. SENTINEL MAN is a performance intelligence system. It contains a crisis channel that routes to trained human services first, but its core function is daily operational intelligence — not therapeutic content.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-item">
          <div class="qa-q">Why is this only for men?</div>
          <div class="qa-a">Because the operator dialect, the failure modes the system models for, and the calibration of its interventions are built around how high-stakes men actually present. The methodology generalises; the calibration doesn't. A version for other audiences may follow — it isn't this product.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-item">
          <div class="qa-q">How is it different from ChatGPT?</div>
          <div class="qa-a">ChatGPT answers what you ask. SENTINEL remembers what you've told it for 90 days, runs scheduled analyses you didn't ask for, surfaces patterns you didn't see, and writes you a daily brief calibrated to who you are. It's an instrument that runs in the background, not a chat box you visit.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-item">
          <div class="qa-q">What does it cost?</div>
          <div class="qa-a">$24.99 AUD/month or $249/year on the web (sentinelman.com). $29.99/month or $299/year via iOS or Android in-app — Apple and Google take a 15-30% cut, which is why web is cheaper. 7-day free trial, no credit card required.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-item">
          <div class="qa-q">Where does the data live? Who sees it?</div>
          <div class="qa-a">Australian-region infrastructure. The operator owns the data — Privacy Act APP 12 export is one tap inside the app, APP 11 deletion is two taps. AI calls are routed through OpenRouter to Anthropic, OpenAI and xAI models — no operator data is used for model training by any of those providers.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">COMPLIANCE GUARDRAILS</div>
      <h2>Frame us right. <strong>Avoid these claims.</strong></h2>
      <div class="press-guides">
        <div class="press-guide ok">
          <div class="press-guide-head">PREFERRED FRAMING</div>
          <ul>
            <li>"Performance intelligence system"</li>
            <li>"AI decision intelligence for men"</li>
            <li>"Operational instrument for high-stakes operators"</li>
            <li>"Built for men who reject wellness framing"</li>
            <li>"Daily AI command brief"</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="press-guide no">
          <div class="press-guide-head">PLEASE AVOID</div>
          <ul>
            <li>"Mental health app" — SENTINEL is not a mental health intervention</li>
            <li>"Therapy alternative" or "AI therapist" — false and creates legal exposure</li>
            <li>"Wellness platform" or "self-care app" — wrong category</li>
            <li>"Mood tracker" — significantly understates the product</li>
            <li>Any claim that SENTINEL diagnoses, treats, or prevents medical conditions</li>
            <li>Any claim of guaranteed outcomes ("will make you more productive", "fixes your sleep")</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="press-aux">SENTINEL MAN is a software product, not a medical device or licensed mental health service. Partner promotions that imply otherwise create risk for both you and us. Stay in the operational / performance / decision-intelligence frame and the legal surface stays clean.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">REFERRAL PROGRAM</div>
      <h2>Coming. <strong>Not live yet.</strong></h2>
      <p class="press-aux">A formal affiliate / referral program with tracked links and revenue share is in planning. Email <a href="mailto:support@sentinelman.com?subject=PARTNER%20-%20Affiliate%20Interest">support@sentinelman.com</a> with subject <code>PARTNER — Affiliate Interest</code> and we'll add you to the list when it ships.</p>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Reuse press.astro styles where possible — keep visual consistency. */
  .press-contact {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    background: rgba(13, 31, 53, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .press-email {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px);
    color: var(--gold);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 220, 0, 0.3);
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .press-email:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--gold); }
  .press-contact p {
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: var(--secondary);
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .press-contact code,
  .press-aux code {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gold);
    background: rgba(255, 220, 0, 0.08);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .press-lines {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .press-line {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: rgba(13, 31, 53, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .press-line-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .press-line-text {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .press-line-text a {
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .press-assets {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .press-asset {
    background: rgba(13, 31, 53, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .asset-tile {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #0D0D1A;
    padding: 24px;
    min-height: 160px;
  }
  .asset-tile-wide { padding: 12px; }
  .asset-tile-small { padding: 36px; }
  .asset-tile img {
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 140px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  .asset-meta {
    padding: 14px 16px 18px;
  }
  .asset-name {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .asset-spec {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--secondary);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .asset-download {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .press-aux {
    margin-top: 18px;
    color: var(--secondary);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .press-aux a { color: var(--gold); }

  .brand-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .brand-block {
    background: rgba(13, 31, 53, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px;
  }
  .brand-block-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .brand-swatch {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    gap: 2px 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #F1F5F9;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }
  .swatch-name {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    grid-row: 1;
  }
  .swatch-hex {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    grid-row: 1;
    text-align: right;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .swatch-use {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    grid-row: 2;
    font-size: 11px;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
  .brand-type {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .brand-type-name {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .brand-type-use {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .brand-voice {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--secondary);
  }
  .brand-voice code {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gold);
    background: rgba(255, 220, 0, 0.08);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .qa-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .qa-item {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: rgba(13, 31, 53, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .qa-q {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .qa-a {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .press-guides {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .press-guide {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .press-guide.ok {
    background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.06);
    border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3);
  }
  .press-guide.no {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.06);
    border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
  }
  .press-guide-head {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .press-guide.ok .press-guide-head { color: #34D399; }
  .press-guide.no .press-guide-head { color: #EF4444; }
  .press-guide ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .press-guide li {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--primary);
    padding: 4px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }
  .press-guide li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
</style>
